[{"id":"app-testing-adb-install-flags","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"App测试","tags":["ADB","安装"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(四)ADB 设备管理.md","articleTitle":"App测试(四)ADB 设备管理","articlePath":"posts/7c0260ba/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(四)ADB 设备管理.md","articleTitle":"App测试(四)ADB 设备管理","articlePath":"posts/7c0260ba/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>adb install 的覆盖、保留数据和清理数据为什么要分开验证？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它们改变的状态不同，直接影响升级、首次安装和数据迁移结论。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>覆盖安装通常保留应用数据，卸载会移除安装包和大部分用户数据，清除数据则保留安装包但重置运行数据。若把三者混成“重新安装”，就无法判断问题来自迁移逻辑、缓存残留还是首次初始化。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>目标\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>推荐动作\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>需要回读\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>升级\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>覆盖安装\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>版本、迁移后数据和会话\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>首次安装\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>卸载后安装\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>引导、权限和默认值\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>干净重跑\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>清除数据\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>数据为空且包仍存在\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-project-background-or-queue","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["项目实战","后台"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十五)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十五)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/dfdedcc6/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十五)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十五)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/dfdedcc6/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>项目任务应使用 \u003ccode>BackgroundTasks\u003c/code> 还是持久队列？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>短小、同进程且失败可记录的审计写入用 \u003ccode>BackgroundTasks\u003c/code>；需要重试、跨进程或长时间运行的任务用持久队列。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>BackgroundTasks 在响应后由当前进程执行，崩溃或重启会丢失任务，不能承诺可靠投递。持久队列保存任务状态并负责重试，API 只返回任务 ID。两种方案都要设计幂等键、状态机和关闭行为，不能把“响应已返回”当作业务副作用一定成功。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-param-ids","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["可诊断性"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(六)参数化与用例建模.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(六)参数化与用例建模","articlePath":"posts/f6690364/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(六)参数化与用例建模.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(六)参数化与用例建模","articlePath":"posts/f6690364/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>参数 ID 应使用 ids、pytest.param 还是 Hook？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>单行语义用 pytest.param(id=…)，一组规则用 ids=，跨项目统一格式才考虑收集 Hook。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>ID 的选择范围应和数据规则一致：单行特殊命名用 \u003ccode>pytest.param\u003c/code>，同一组规则用 \u003ccode>ids=\u003c/code>，跨项目统一才值得写收集 Hook。\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">cases = [\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    pytest.param(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;vip&quot;\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"number\">20\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">id\u003c/span>=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;vip-20&quot;\u003c/span>),\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    pytest.param(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;guest&quot;\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"number\">0\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">id\u003c/span>=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;guest-0&quot;\u003c/span>),\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">]\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.mark.parametrize(\u003cspan class=\"params\">\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;level, rate&quot;\u003c/span>, cases\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">test_discount\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">level, rate\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    ...\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>稳定 ID 应能让失败报告直接指向业务输入，并且不能重复；动态生成时还要检查转义、Unicode 和路径长度，确保复制 Node ID 后仍能精确复跑。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a7-systemctl-enable","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["systemd","服务"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(七)进程任务与服务管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(七)进程任务与服务管理","articlePath":"posts/23ca1872/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(七)进程任务与服务管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(七)进程任务与服务管理","articlePath":"posts/23ca1872/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>systemctl start 和 enable 分别改变什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>start 改变当前运行状态，enable 建立开机启动关系；enable 不等于立刻启动。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>这两个动作作用在不同状态上，可以分别读回：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">systemctl start demo.service\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">systemctl is-active demo.service\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">systemctl \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">enable\u003c/span> demo.service\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">systemctl is-enabled demo.service\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>is-active\u003c/code> 说明当前是否有运行中的 unit，\u003ccode>is-enabled\u003c/code> 说明启动关系是否已建立。\u003ccode>enable\u003c/code> 默认只创建启动链接，不会把停止的服务立刻拉起来；如果目标是“现在运行且重启后仍运行”，需要明确执行并验证两次。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]